 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Roughly twenty minutes per thin layer of oil, so five minutes per thin layer of oil and five minutes per thin layer of paint. Then you should start thinking about it now. A simple card with a picture of the finished piece is easy to put together. You could also buy a cheap print of the same image and use that as the front. People would still be surprised and pleased by the real painting inside. It will feel dry to the touch, and a sharp edge will appear around the paint. If you doubt it, wait twenty four hours.",
